<includeonly>{{#invoke:SV/BibleQuote|main}}</includeonly><noinclude>
Quotes a Bible passage through BibleGet. Parameters:
* <code>ref</code> (required): the reference, in any notation BibleGet accepts, with book names in the wiki's language (e.g. <code>Jn 3:16</code>, <code>Gv 3,16</code>, <code>Jean 3,16</code>).
* <code>version</code>: a BibleGet version code; defaults to the wiki's version (NABRE, CEI2008, BLPD; Nova Vulgata on fr/de/pt, with a note).
* <code>inline</code>: <code>0</code> shows the passage as a block instead of a hover quote.

<code><nowiki>{{SV Bible quote|ref=Jn 3:16}}</nowiki></code>
</noinclude>
